===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[eminent]] [[domain]]|-}}

# {{context|US|lang=en}} The right of a [[government]] over the private lands within its [[jurisdiction]]. Usually [[invoke]]d to compel land owners to sell their property in preparation for a major construction project such as a [[freeway]].
:: ''The city council used '''eminent domain''' to make me sell my store.''

